# Colours that tell task cards apart: card 01 is sky, 02 amber, 03 moss … and 09 starts over.
# Every window working on a card (agent, reviewer, its terminal, VS Code on its worktree) gets
# the card's colour as a thick window border, and terminals get a dark tint of it.
#   border  window border (niri)        tint  terminal background (Ghostty, dark glass)
